     "\r\n<font face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span>Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span>Join us for our practical workshop on </span><strong><span>Occupancy Modelling in R in January (18-21).</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span>This workshop offers hands-on training in occupancy modelling, from preparing ecological detection data and fitting models to interpreting results and assessing model performance using the </span><strong><span>unmarked</span></strong><span> R package.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span>Through lectures, live coding and practical exercises, you will gain valuable skills to apply occupancy models to your own ecological research.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><strong><span>Places are limited, so don&#39;t miss this opportunity!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Course website: <a rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/occupancymodels/</a> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span>Best regards,</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\">Carlo</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR</p></font>\r\n\r\n"
